| A handler defined inside a linked module sending upward. The `to
| base` must mean THIS module's parent — the file that linked us —
| even though the handler runs later, from whatever frame emitted
| here. If it resolved against the caller's depth instead, the
| particle would go to the wrong level (or nowhere) and the test's
| assert would fail.
Ask => {
    emit Ping { value = 1 } to base get up
    return Ask { got = up.value }
}
